35,2,1,talk,Servas,,The appraisal data is alarming. Hardware adds six weeks to our audit. We must avoid that.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Asuka,,Retention data is clear. The practice and field sensor tools kept customers. The shop tool lost a third.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minako,,The credit line is useless for subscriptions. It only values stock. We cannot borrow against software.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mio,,Recruiters can't place field crews in under four months. That is a dealbreaker for physical operations.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,Security reviews for medical data take three quarters. That is too long for a seed stage.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minako, if we can't borrow against subscriptions, we need assets with tangible value or strong cash flow.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, three quarters is too long. We need a product that deploys fast without heavy compliance.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Servas, exactly. The reserve calls are also higher than modelled. We need a company that doesn't bleed cash.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, the field sensor crew issue is real. But if the software is simple, maybe we don't need field crews?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, the bank tool never missed a release. That suggests a stable, low-friction deployment path.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,The independent checks show software reports are opaque. Hardware sends verifiable readings. I prefer verifiable.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Asuka,,The exits were back-office tooling. The write-off was a physical premises. We should stick to software.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minako,,The reserve accounts show equipment-heavy holdings called money early. We need a lean software play.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mio,,"The adviser bench has logistics experts, but they haven't taken anything. We are short on operational help.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The delivery records show the bank tool was reliable. The device maker lost five months. Software wins.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,"I am leaning towards the bank reconciliation tool. It is software, but it deals with financial data.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"I agree. The clinic scheduler is software, but medical records trigger long security reviews.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minako,,"The clinic scheduler is risky. The bank tool is pure software, no hardware, no field crews.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Mio,,"The bank tool doesn't need shift supervisors. It just needs developers, which we can find.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"The bank tool fits. No external delays, no security review bottleneck, no hardware appraisal.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
