68,3,2,talk,Mio,,D's team is likely small and focused. We won't be bogged down in staffing requests.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Toshio,,D's deployment is fast. No external dependencies. It is the only one that fits all our constraints.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Servas,,I vote for D. It is the only one that doesn't break our quarter-end close.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"I vote for D. It is the only one with a proven, low-friction model.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
