73,3,3,talk,Mio,,I vote for D. It is the only one we can actually staff and support.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I vote for D. It is the only one that avoids the delivery and security traps.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
